# Game_SimpleCountdown — Tap Race to Zero (ID 3)
# Files: src/coordinator/Game_SimpleCountdown.h, Game_SimpleCountdown.cpp
# HTML: data/game_countdown_setup.html, game_countdown_names.html, game_countdown_run.html

## GAMEPLAY
Competitive countdown: players click to decrement counter to zero. First to zero wins.
Optional time limit, warning beeps at 5s, auto-stop on first win.

## CONFIG
- activePucks (1-12), startCount, timeLimitSeconds, warnEnd, stopOnWin

## STATES
CD_SETUP → CD_PREPARE (3.1s) → CD_RUNNING → CD_FINISHED

## KEY MECHANICS
- 300ms debounce per click
- EFF_PROGRESS: fill = currentCount/startCount ratio
- Winner: first to 0 gets RAINBOW, later finishers get DOUBLE_CHASE
- 10s winner animation then lights reset to breathe
- Flash: 150ms white flash on each click

## COMMANDS
setup, reset, config_players, config_count, config_time, config_warn, config_stopwin, start, stop, exit

## STATUS JSON
{state, elapsed, winnerTime, players: [{id, count, finishTime}]}
